S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,50,73,71,69,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,50,73,71,69,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,50,73,71,69,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,50,73,71,69,75],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"刘焉麾下武将。早年随刘焉入蜀，刘焉死后拥立其子刘璋为益州牧，任征东中郎将，屯兵朐䏰。曾建议分巴郡为三，以巩固地方势力。后因刘璋与部将庞羲失和、益州民怨，遂联合当地大族反叛，蜀郡、广汉等地响应。次年围攻成都，被刘璋麾下东州兵击败，退至江州，为部下庞乐、李异所杀。《后汉书》称其‘在巴中甚得众心’。","tc":"劉焉麾下武將。早年隨劉焉入蜀，劉焉死后擁立其子劉璋為益州牧，任征東中郎將，屯兵朐䏰。曾建議分巴郡為三，以鞏固地方勢力。后因劉璋與部將龐羲失和、益州民怨，遂聯合當地大族反叛，蜀郡、廣漢等地響應。次年圍攻成都，被劉璋麾下東州兵擊敗，退至江州，為部下龐樂、李異所殺。《后漢書》稱其‘在巴中甚得眾心’。","en":"An officer under Liu Yan. In his early years, he accompanied Liu Yan into Shu. After Liu Yan's death, he supported his son Liu Zhang to become Governor of Yi Province, served as General of the Household Who Conquers the East, and garrisoned Quren. He once proposed dividing Ba Commandery into three to consolidate regional factions. Later, provoked by the discord between Liu Zhang and his general Pang Xi as well as widespread grievances among the people of Yi Province, he allied with prominent local clans in rebellion, drawing responses from Shu Commandery, Guanghan, and other areas. The following year, he besieged Chengdu but was defeated by Liu Zhang's Eastern Infantry. Retreating to Jiangzhou, he was killed by his subordinates Pang Le and Li Yi. The Book of the Later Han notes that he ‘greatly won the hearts of the people in Bazhong.’","jp":"劉焉配下の武将。早くから劉焉に従って蜀に入り、劉焉の死後はその子である劉璋を擁立して益州牧となし、征東中郎将に任ぜられて朐䏰に駐屯した。地方の勢力を固めるため、巴郡を三分割することを進言したこともある。後に劉璋と部将の龐羲が不和となり、益州で民の怨嗟が高まると、現地の豪族と結んで反乱を起こし、蜀郡や広漢などがこれに呼応した。翌年、成都を包囲するも劉璋配下の東州兵に敗れ、江州へと退いたが、部下の龐楽や李異によって殺害された。『後漢書』には「巴中に在りて甚だ衆心を得たり」と記されている。","kr":"유언 휘하의 무장. 일찍이 유언을 따라 촉으로 들어갔으며, 유언이 죽자 그의 아들 유장을 익주목으로 옹립하였다. 이후 정동중랑장에 임명되어 구인에 주둔했다. 지방 세력을 공고히 하고자 파군을 셋으로 나눌 것을 건의하기도 했다. 훗날 유장이 부장 방희와 불화를 겪고 익주 백성들의 원망을 사자, 현지 호족들과 연합하여 반란을 일으켰으며 촉군과 광한 등지가 이에 호응했다. 이듬해 성도를 포위 공격했으나 유장 휘하의 동주병에게 패배하여 강주로 퇴각했고, 부하 방악과 이이에게 살해당했다. 《후한서》에서는 그를 두고 '파중에서 크게 인심을 얻었다'고 평했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1041015","remark":"普武","surname":"赵","surnameTc":"趙","surnameEn":"Zhao","surnameJp":"趙","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"韪","nameTc":"韙","nameEn":"Wei","nameJp":"韙","nameKr":"위","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"赵韪","power":"WJ10072","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1029","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"50","wise":"73","politics":"71","charm":"69","will":"75","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"21/50/24/28/20/